uvre on an urban street, from having the overtaken vehicle ahead to having it behind", "source": "overtaking-manoeuvre durations in naturalistic driving studies"}, {"name": "p.overtake_same_direction_cos", "unit": "ratio", "value": 0.9, "convention": "cosine of the largest heading difference (about 25 degrees) at which two vehicles count as travelling in the same direction while one moves out to pass the other", "source": "lane-change heading angles in naturalistic driving data"}, {"name": "p.turn_window", "unit": "s", "value": 10.0, "convention": "the longest duration of a turn at a junction by a bicycle or a scooter, from the start of its heading change to its end", "source": "junction turning-time observations"}, {"name": "p.turn_heading_min", "unit": "deg", "value": 45.0, "convention": "the smallest heading change over the turn window at which a change of course counts as a turn rather than a lane change or a drift", "source": "intersection turning-geometry conventions"}, {"name": "p.u_turn_heading_min", "unit": "deg", "value": 135.0, "convention": "the smallest heading change magnitude over the turn window at which a turn counts as a reversal of direction", "source": "intersection turning-geometry conventions"}, {"name": "p.turn_yaw_rate_tol", "unit": "deg/s", "value": 3.0, "convention": "the yaw-rate magnitude at or below which a road user's heading counts as no longer turning: the yaw-rate noise floor of the source", "source": "yaw-rate noise of the acquisition source"}, {"name": "p.halt_speed_tolerance", "unit": "m/s", "value": 0.1, "convention": "the speed at or below which a sampled speed counts as no movement: the source's speed resolution", "source": "speed resolution of the acquisition source"}, {"name": "p.parking_min_duration", "unit": "s", "value": 180.0, "convention": "the longest halt counted as temporary, as for loading or unloading: a common time limit of a passenger loading zone", "source": "municipal passenger-loading-zone time limits"}], "gaps