rection_cos is recognized at the judged observation; and at some observation of the act (from its beginning, the last observation of the window behind at which b was ahead with aligned headings, to its recognition) the subject occupies a highway h on which an st.centre_line c lies and every lane lying on h has a single lane in its direction (st.lane_adjacency count), the two-lane two-directional highway. b is quantified there, not a binder.", "obligation": "At every observation of the act at which the subject occupies such a highway h and prim.region_lateral_offset(subject, c) is negative for a centre line c lying on h (the subject on the left side of the center), all of the following hold; otherwise the duty is violated: st.sight_distance at the subject's point is at least the subject's kin.speed times p.passing_sight_time; every road user u of DEF-NRS-484A-285::traffic with rel.oncoming(subject, u) under p.oncoming_heading_cos is at a rel.centre_distance of at least that same distance; and neither b nor any road user u of DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle oncoming to the subject is in rel.contact with the subject, or has prim.closest_approach_within(subject, u) over p.conflict_horizon with prim.closest_approach_distance below p.conflict_centre_clearance.", "params": ["p.overtake_window", "p.overtake_same_direction_cos", "p.passing_sight_time", "p.oncoming_heading_cos", "p.conflict_horizon", "p.conflict_centre_clearance"], "narrowings": [{"span": "s2", "why": "'driven to the left side of the center' is read as the subject's reference point lying beyond the centre line to its left; a body that only straddles the line with its reference point on the right is not read.", "kind": "reading"}, {"span": "s2", "why": "'driven' is read through the vehicle's controlled motion: the duty binds the vehicle's conduct whoever controls it.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}, {"span": "s5", "why": "'clearly visible' is read through the sight distance of the subject's place, what could be seen from it, not through any driver's perception.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "perception"}, {"span": "s7", "why": "The exception is read at the observations of the act at which the subject is on the left side of the center: visibility and freedom from oncoming traffic are required while the left side is used.", "kind": "reading"}], "scenarios": [{"name": "forbid", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "On a highway with a centre line and one lane in each direction, the subject moves left of the centre line to pass b; a road user u of traffic is oncoming in that lane at a centre distance below the subject's speed times p.passing_sight_time, and its closest approach within p.conflict_horizon falls below p.conflict_centre_clearance; the pass is recognized."}, {"name": "permit", "expected": "compliant", "narrative": "The same pass with st.sight_distance at the subject's point far above its speed times p.passing_sight_time at every observation of the act and no oncoming road user in the scene; the subject keeps clear of b."}, {"name": "idle", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "The subject follows b on the two-lane highway without passing it."}, {"name": "blind", "expected": "unknown", "narrative": "The pass of permit with st.sight_distance not observed on the source.", "masked": ["st.sight_distance"]}, {"name": "occasion_s3", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "The pass begins where the highway has two lanes in each direction and, after a lane drop, continues on a stretch with one lane in each direction, where the subject is left of the centre line with an oncoming vehicle closer than the required distance: the condition holds for part of the act only."}, {"name": "occasion_s3_outside", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "The highway has one lane in each direction only before the act began; the whole pass is made after the road widens to two lanes in each direction."}, {"name": "occasion_s5", "expected": "violated", "