{"node_id": "NRS_484B_210_3", "law_refs": ["NRS-484B-210-3"], "subject": {"binder": "subject", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}, "segmentation": [{"id": "s1", "text": "The driver of a vehicle", "role": "subject"}, {"id": "s2", "text": "shall not overtake and pass another vehicle upon the right", "role": "obligation"}, {"id": "s3", "text": "when such movement requires driving off the paved portion of the highway.", "role": "condition"}], "elements": [{"span": "s1", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"], "derived": [], "justification": "'vehicle' is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle, claimed whole. 'driver' (DEF-NRS-484A-080) is a relational role read through the vehicle's controlled motion (observable_reading, agency)."}, {"span": "s2", "atoms": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"], "derived": ["drv.interaction.overtake_pass_on_right"], "justification": "'overtake and pass another vehicle upon the right' is the act drv.interaction.overtake_pass_on_right(subject, b), 'Road user a overtakes and passes road user b on b's right'; b is of DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle."}, {"span": "s3", "atoms": ["rel.occupies", "st.shoulder", "st.road_edge"], "derived": [], "justification": "'driving off the paved portion of the highway': at some observation of the act the subject's footprint overlaps (rel.occupies, 'a road user's footprint overlaps a lane / region') an st.shoulder whose paved attribute is unset ('the part of the highway beside the roadway ...; paved attribute'), or an st.road_edge whose paved attribute, 'for the surface beyond it', is unset, so that part of the body is at or beyond the edge of the pavement. 'requires' is read through the movement as made (reading). 'highway' keeps its extent: the paved portion is any paved part of it, so a paved shoulder or sidewalk is not 'off' it."}], "operationalizations": [], "assumptions": [], "intentions": [], "compositions": [], "residues": [], "binders": [{"name": "subj