uty is violated.", "params": ["p.passing_sight_time"], "narrowings": [{"span": "s2", "why": "'driven to the left side of the highway' is read as the subject's reference point lying beyond the centre line to its left.", "kind": "reading"}, {"span": "s2", "why": "'driven' is read through the vehicle's controlled motion: the duty binds the vehicle's conduct whoever controls it.", "kind": "observable_reading", "category": "agency"}, {"span": "s3", "why": "'the view' is read through the sight distance of the subject's place, what could be seen from it, not through any driver's perception.", "kind": "reading"}], "scenarios": [{"name": "forbid", "expected": "violated", "narrative": "The subject moves toward an st.elevated_structure within the stated 100 feet, st.sight_distance at its point below its speed times p.passing_sight_time, its reference point left of the centre line."}, {"name": "permit", "expected": "compliant", "narrative": "The same approach with the subject right of the centre line."}, {"name": "idle", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "The subject approaches a bridge within the stated distance with st.sight_distance far above the bound, left of the centre line."}, {"name": "blind", "expected": "unknown", "narrative": "The subject approaches a bridge within the stated distance left of the centre line; st.sight_distance is not observed.", "masked": ["st.sight_distance"]}, {"name": "branch_1", "expected": "not_applicable", "narrative": "The same approach with short sight distance on an st.one_way_roadway."}], "literals": [{"span": "s4", "text": "100 feet", "value": 100, "unit": "ft"}], "param_proposals": [{"name": "p.passing_sight_time", "unit": "s", "value": 11.0, "convention": "the MUTCD minimum passing sight distance (Table 3B-1, the warrant for a no-passing zone) divided by the prevailing speed it is tabulated for: about eleven seconds of travel across 25 to 70 mph; the sight distance or the clear distance a pass needs is the subject's speed times 