ge to its end", "source": "junction turning-time observations"}, {"name": "p.turn_heading_min", "unit": "deg", "value": 45.0, "convention": "the smallest heading change over the turn window at which a change of course counts as a turn rather than a lane change or a drift", "source": "intersection turning-geometry conventions"}, {"name": "p.u_turn_heading_min", "unit": "deg", "value": 135.0, "convention": "the smallest heading change magnitude over the turn window at which a turn counts as a reversal of direction", "source": "intersection turning-geometry conventions"}, {"name": "p.turn_yaw_rate_tol", "unit": "deg/s", "value": 3.0, "convention": "the yaw-rate magnitude at or below which a road user's heading counts as no longer turning: the yaw-rate noise floor of the source", "source": "yaw-rate noise of the acquisition source"}, {"name": "p.halt_speed_tolerance", "unit": "m/s", "value": 0.1, "convention": "the speed at or below which a sampled speed counts as no movement: the source's speed resolution", "source": "speed resolution of the acquisition source"}, {"name": "p.parking_min_duration", "unit": "s", "value": 180.0, "convention": "the longest halt counted as temporary, as for loading or unloading: a common time limit of a passenger loading zone", "source": "municipal passenger-loading-zone time limits"}], "gaps": [{"span": "s10", "kind": "atom", "proposal": "`st.private_way_entrance` | the place where a way in private ownership — a private road or driveway — meets the highway, through which a vehicle enters or leaves the highway; the junction of an alley, a public way, with another way is not one **Not a stand-in for:** an alley's junction or an intersection | general", "nearest": "st.driveway_or_alley_entrance — 'Not a stand-in for: which of them meets the highway there — the kind does not tell an alley's entrance from a private road's or driveway's'; st.alley — a way within a block, not the place where a private way meets the highway"}], "gap_resolutions": 