{"node_id": "NRS_484B_413_2", "law_refs": ["NRS-484B-413-2"], "subject": {"binder": "subject", "class_elements": ["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]}, "segmentation": [{"id": "s1", "text": "A signal of intention to turn right or left, or otherwise turn a vehicle from a direct course, shall be given continuously", "role": "obligation"}, {"id": "s2", "text": "during not less than the last 100 feet traveled", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s3", "text": "in a business or residential district", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s4", "text": "and not less than the last 300 feet traveled", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s5", "text": "in any other area", "role": "condition"}, {"id": "s6", "text": "prior to changing the course", "role": "trigger"}, {"id": "s7", "text": "of a vehicle.", "role": "subject"}, {"id": "s8", "text": "This rule shall be observed, regardless of the weather.", "role": "condition"}], "elements": [{"span": "s1", "atoms": ["sig.turn_indicator", "sig.hand_signal", "ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"], "derived": [], "justification": "'A signal of intention to turn right or left, or otherwise turn ... from a direct course' is the signal itself, not a declared intention: sig.turn_indicator, 'the turn indicator state in {off, left, right}', to the side of the course change, or sig.hand_signal, 'a driver's or rider's arm signal; meaning in {..., left, right, ...}', to that side; the indicator's exclusion (not the turn or lane change itself) does not apply, the words naming the signal. 'given continuously' is the signal holding at every observation of the window the next spans state. 'a vehicle' is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle."}, {"span": "s2", "atoms": ["kin.path_length"], "derived": [], "justification": "'during not less than the last 100 feet traveled' is a .path window of the stated 100 feet of the subject's path behind the course change; the window reads kin.path_length, 'distance travelled along the body's path since the start 